2. SEARCH INTENT: the focus keyword appears in the title, the first paragraph and at least one h2. The introduction answers the reader's question directly in its first 2-3 sentences. Title 45-70 characters, excerpt 140-160 characters.
3. DEPTH: strengthen shallow sections with a concrete example, step or decision criterion. Delete repetitive and filler sentences.
4. READABILITY: paragraphs have at most 4 sentences; turn long blocks into lists/tables. Table-of-contents links match the h2 ids.
5. STYLE: remove AI-sounding phrases ({{ ($('Config').first().json.banned_phrases || []).map(p => '"' + p + '"').join(', ') }}) and invented personal experiences. Natural, clear, expert {{ $('Config').first().json.language }}.
6. LINKS: keep the existing internal and external links; do not invent new URLs.
